# The build context is what the Dockerfile copies and nothing else: without
# this, `docker build` would upload data/ -- extracts, compiled styles, tile
# caches, 2.3 GB on a dev machine -- on every deploy, for an image that only
# copies app/ and requirements.txt.
*
!Dockerfile
!requirements.txt
!app/

# Inside app/: caches, never code.
app/tools/.cache
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache